  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strategic Hub for Article 6 Readiness Exchange (SHARE)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&#x2019;s overall objective is to develop the knowledge ecosystem (creation, transfers, exchanges, and management) needed to ensure successful Article 6 readiness journeys. Through it, Parties engaged in Article 6 preparations would benefit from improved access to high-quality knowledge and opportunities to engage with peers and experts, which would in turn enhance the quality and relevance of their preparations.</narrative>
  </description>
